## 46. Final Architecture Decision

**Decision:**

> Nandi Runtime will integrate with the existing RaamaEsha Event Platform rather than creating a parallel event or telemetry storage system.

> Runtime state tables remain authoritative.

> Nandi events will represent meaningful runtime occurrences and will be produced by an explicitly defined runtime event producer.

> Migration 075 is intentionally deferred until the event producer and emission architecture establish a concrete database requirement.

> No new event, telemetry, or generic runtime-observability table is authorized by this ADR.

